DISCLAIMER ON FINANCIAL CONTENT

This repository contains research code, backtest results, and analysis
related to algorithmic trading. None of the content constitutes financial,
investment, tax, or legal advice. All numerical results are historical
backtests and do not predict future performance. Past performance is not
indicative of future results.

The authors specifically document (see POST_MORTEM.md and paper/drafts/main.md)
that none of the strategies tested in this repository demonstrated a
generalizable trading edge in out-of-sample testing. Any reader using this
code or its findings to make actual trading or investment decisions does so
entirely at their own risk.

Paper drafts in paper/drafts/ are released under CC-BY 4.0 upon arXiv
publication.
